   (Note: the MACE engine is domain-mismatched for liquid organic electrolytes and diverges (see md_runner notes); the fallback route for the top-electrolyte diffusion endorsement is the OpenMM + OPLS-AA pipeline — LigParGen/CL&amp;P parameters, see the MD endorsement scripts in the repo's runs.)
